from filename "../../module/ffmpeg_hear.pya" ob name microphone hear to name hear be import do
exists su name ffmpeg input ob text "lavfi" be default ya
exists su name ffmpeg input device ob text "anullsrc=r=16000:cl=mono" be default ya
su name prompt ob text "Recording 1 second from ffmpeg input into /tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav and transcribing it." be write do
su name note ob text "Override 'ffmpeg input' and 'ffmpeg input device' to use your microphone." be write do
exists su name output ob text "" be text ya
su name output from wo microphone during num 1 to filename "/tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be hear do
ob name output be write do
